            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I would be moderately happy with generating an `#error` here with clang. Unless there's a _good_ fix then I think clang is just defective here and that failing to compile is the right thing to do (and certainly better than hanging at runtime).\n\nI'd say this should happen even on freethreading builds because the GIL can end up enabled.",
